<title>USA: CITGO Petroleum Corp Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>CITGO Petroleum Corp Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, OKla. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net			$33,700		 $31,100.</p>
<p> Oper Income	     83,000		   77,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,300,000		2,700,000</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Net			$79,800		 $107,400</p>
<p> Oper Income	    210,100		  245,100</p>
<p> Revs		   9,300,000		8,000,000</p>
<p>	    (All data omits 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company is owned by PDV America Inc, a subsidiary of Petroleos de Venezuela SA, Venezuela's national oil company.</p>
